# PSR-5f2 — outbox ops cluster

## Scope (exactly three files)

| File | Prior direct calls | Reason |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| `apps/api/src/outbox/outbox-failed.ts` | 2 | `BG_OUTBOX_OPS` |
| `apps/api/src/outbox/outbox-mark-done.ts` | 1 | `BG_OUTBOX_OPS` |
| `apps/api/src/outbox/outbox-queue-counts.ts` | 4 | `BG_OUTBOX_OPS` |

All replace `getPrismaAdmin()` with
`getBackgroundAdminClient(BACKGROUND_ADMIN_REASON.BG_OUTBOX_OPS)`.

## Non-goals

- No algorithm / SQL / retry-policy changes
- No `BG_OUTBOX_RELAY` / `BG_OUTBOX_REPLAY` / finance recon in this wave
- Client module unchanged (reason already present from f0)

